      <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 16:38:40 +0300</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>Eject external and network volumes from the popover; when macOS refuses, see who is using the disk (Spotlight, Time Machine, Finder, and more) with Retry and Force Eject.</li>
          <li>Read-only mounts (e.g. mounted disk images) no longer clutter the volume list.</li>
          <li>Fix crash when closing the largest-files view while a scan was in flight.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
